185 | #        to create changes inline and shows it on a word by
186 | #        word basis using CSS. This is much superior to the
187 | #        traditional diff provider, however, it is still quite
188 | #        new and not much tested. YMMV.
189 | #    * ExternalDiffProvider - uses a system diff program (which
190 | #        can be configured using "jspwiki.diffCommand") to
191 | #        create an unified (!) diff.
